7fYuIR4qOW4kQAiyyiyz8zGysTmNgLnv5AFTV1yA3lB_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTHXVCvS0ZDSn81ORm4sY58CsjNe7oZCXrd_cIWnTqf8w&oe=6AE89367"}, {"file_name": "peek.png", "id": "1009464856621649", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_1009464859954982_7090744758627338677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4MUn57EZOg0Q7kNvwHwOw1O&_nc_oc=Adpp64AFZGLGq6mjOpJlXhhF4IRPNUvDc4wGl3wIFaIKC72YCDEp7f9-tza1IAPYzX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0Z9s7XU2NWLH7h6XGWsOTyW1Gr_8fYIVLGhrXLwW7Bg&oe=6AE8B01C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "banner.png", "id": "636604377435150", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003244_636604380768483_6976895474501699949_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pe6A9QQsSdsQ7kNvwG-CYJ1&_nc_oc=AdprGJYBB6tAh_VJS6ArjwywClCJtnxYxap69VyNukhFjS_8zWaMshCEUcDVH9hHyJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSG7uBrB2pMJV3w7qjHRqoce1Q6ee2st06xZv3n6QzAWw&oe=6AE8AAF6"}, "display_name": "Puppet VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Puppet VR is like a virtual puppet theater. Pick a bunny, make a recording, repeat. Improvise a funny scene, or have conversations with yourself!\n\n**Features**\n- 4 space bunnies, controlled by YOU\n- Record your voice, movement, or both\n- Play back your recordings - all 4 at the same time\n- Play in Quest Standalone - no wires needed\n\n**Your creativity's the limit!**\n- Create funny scenes, with yourself from the past\n- Go a capella, and make the bunnies sing\n- Host a bunny dance party\n- ... And more!\n\nPuppet VR is currently in development", "short_description": "A virtual puppet theater where every actor is YOU!\n\nControl up to 4 bunnies at the same time, and use them to make a movie, sing a song or host a dance party - your creativity is the limit!"}]}, "developer_name": "Daniel Tauritis", "developer_privacy_policy_url